B.bfA=new A.nB("Civil Plaint \u2014 Recovery of Money","Draft a Civil Suit for recovery of money against the defendant for an outstanding loan/business debt. Include: the amount due, date of the transaction/agreement, repeated demands made for repayment, and the relief sought \u2014 recovery of the principal amount with interest.")
